OL,3,GNEWSA'Our charity lost #25,000 during
OL,4,Aroad closure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and organisations hit by the
OL,7,Fclosure of a dual carriageway at the
OL,8,Fcentre of a wildfire have expressed
OL,9,Ftheir relief at the road's reopening.
OL,11,FA major incident was declared after a
OL,12,Fvan fire on the A31 near Ringwood on 9
OL,13,FAugust went on to destroy about 1.6 sq
OL,14,Fkm (0.6 sq miles) of heathland,
OL,15,Fprompting a near two-week closure of
OL,16,Fthe route, which links Bournemouth and
OL,17,FSouthampton
OL,19,FFurzey Gardens, a charity-run centre
OL,20,Ffor people with learning disabilities
OL,21,Fin Minstead said visitors fell by 50%,
OL,22,Fresulting in a loss of #25,000.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
