OL,3,GNEWSA'Our charity lost #25,000 during
OL,4,Aroad closure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways reopened the road on
OL,7,FSaturday, though a 40mph speed limit
OL,8,Fremains on the eastbound carriageway
OL,9,Fdue to a damaged central reservation
OL,10,Fbarrier.
